            "richTextValue" : "<!-- Home page body (one HTML block under the hero). Styled in theme.css -->\n<div class=\"lsbc-wrap\">\n\n  <!-- Topics: round links with an icon and a label (Architectural Digest style). Icons are decorative -->\n  <nav class=\"lsbc-circles\" aria-label=\"Topics\">\n    <a class=\"lsbc-circle\" href=\"/LPI/s/renew-license-permit\"><span class=\"lsbc-circle__ring\"><img src=\"/sfsites/c/resource/PortalIconLicense\" alt=\"\"></span><span class=\"lsbc-circle__label\">Renew a license</span></a>\n    <a class=\"lsbc-circle\" href=\"/LPI/s/apply-license-permit\"><span class=\"lsbc-circle__ring\"><img src=\"/sfsites/c/resource/PortalIconApply\" alt=\"\"></span><span class=\"lsbc-circle__label\">Apply</span></a>\n    <a class=\"lsbc-circle\" href=\"/LPI/s/search-license-permit-holder\"><span class=\"lsbc-circle__ring\"><img src=\"/sfsites/c/resource/PortalIconLookup\" alt=\"\"></span><span class=\"lsbc-circle__label\">Look up a license</span></a>\n    <a class=\"lsbc-circle\" href=\"/LPI/s/find-a-school\"><span class=\"lsbc-circle__ring\"><img src=\"/sfsites/c/resource/PortalIconSchool\" alt=\"\"></span><span class=\"lsbc-circle__label\">Find a school</span></a>\n    <a class=\"lsbc-circle\" href=\"/LPI/s/forms-and-resources\"><span class=\"lsbc-circle__ring\"><img src=\"/sfsites/c/resource/PortalIconForms\" alt=\"\"></span><span class=\"lsbc-circle__label\">Forms</span></a>\n    <a class=\"lsbc-circle\" href=\"/LPI/s/file-a-complaint\"><span class=\"lsbc-circle__ring\"><img src=\"/sfsites/c/resource/PortalIconComplaint\" alt=\"\"></span><span class=\"lsbc-circle__label\">File a complaint</span></a>\n  </nav>\n\n  <!-- Promo strip between hairlines (Vogue style) -->\n  <div class=\"lsbc-promo\">\n    <img src=\"/sfsites/c/resource/PortalSeal\" alt=\"\">\n    <p>Renew, pay and track your applications online, any time.</p>\n    <a class=\"lsbc-button\" href=\"/LPI/s/renew-license-permit\">Renew now</a>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Board News & Publications: the heading here, the tiles are the CMS collection that follows this block -->\n  <h2 class=\"lsbc-rubric\" id=\"lsbc-news-title\">Board news &amp; publications</h2>\n</div>"
